# LaundroStat presentation source

The complete, current slide-by-slide replacement copy is maintained in:

- `docs/laundrostat-canva-update-brief.md`

Use the brief when updating the 14-slide Canva presentation. It reflects the live product at https://laundrostat.vercel.app/demo and supersedes the earlier weight/load-scoring, QR/sensor, public-chat, and shame-based pitch language.

Do not present unsupported features as shipped. The current showcase is a Supabase- and Typesense-backed synthetic demo of Clean-O-Meter recency/consistency, consenting friend search and preset nudges, Wash Mate schedule matching, Squeaky/Stinky Squads, Dorm Wars, and isolated saved demo actions. It has no live CSC integration, machine sensor, load-weight measurement, cycle verification, or uploaded proof.
